OL,3,GNEWSAMore fines issued to curb badly
OL,4,Aparked e-bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestminster City Council is issuing
OL,7,Fthousands more fines for badly parked
OL,8,Fdockless e-bikes since it began its
OL,9,Fenforcement crackdown on rogue parking.
OL,11,FSo far more than 5,000 fixed penalty
OL,12,Fnotices (FPN) have been given to
OL,13,Foperators since the start of the
OL,14,F2026-27 financial year, while only
OL,15,F1,259 were issued the previous year.
OL,17,FA sub-committee heard that if the
OL,18,Fcrackdown continued at the same rate,
OL,19,FWestminster was forecast to issue 9,648
OL,20,Fdockless bike FPNs by the end of the
OL,21,Fyear ` a potential seven-fold increase.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
